\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the player's choice, the game will present multiple different endings. Can you successfully stop your junior sister, or will you ultimately succumb to the demon path? Every decision is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jiang Shi 2: Curse of Soul &quot;official communication group QQ: 752209909</p>","developers":["\u8c2d\u6d69\u7fd4"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016520/header.jpg?t=1748729152","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3016520/722608/edf423886f627ef774f0d80acb3619257a9538c1/1750958092/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737660181","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3016520/722608/edf423886f627ef774f0d80acb3619257a9538c1/1750958092/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737660181","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3016520/722608/edf423886f627ef774f0d80acb3619257a9538c1/1750958092/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1737660181","id":257035961,"name":"trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257035961/69c068ae37b6212434ec1e2cae8bbcb89d3bede8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737660181"}],"name":"The Jiang Shi 2 \uff1aCurse of  Soul","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"optio